---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Solusi Industri — Joyo Digitama Solusi"
  description="Solusi digital untuk sektor manufaktur, logistik, smart building, dan energi. Hasil terbukti dengan outcome yang terukur."
  path="solutions"
  lang="id"
>
  <!-- Hero Halaman -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-tag" style="margin-bottom:24px;display:block;">// industri</span>
      <h1>Solusi <span class="phosphor">Industri</span></h1>
      <p>Solusi digital yang disesuaikan dengan hasil terbukti di berbagai industri</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Kartu Solusi -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon green"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-7 5V8l-7 5V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Manufaktur</h2>
          <p>Monitoring produksi, sistem manajemen kualitas, dan solusi predictive maintenance untuk pabrik pintar.</p>
          <div class="case-study green">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18" /><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12" /></svg>
            Peningkatan OEE 23%
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag green">MES</span>
            <span class="tag green">Andon System</span>
            <span class="tag green">Predictive Maintenance</span>
            <span class="tag green">Quality Control</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon blue"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" /><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8" /><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5" /><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Logistik &amp; Supply Chain</h2>
          <p>Pelacakan armada, manajemen gudang, dan solusi visibilitas supply chain untuk operasi logistik.</p>
          <div class="case-study blue">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18" /><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12" /></svg>
            Pengurangan Waktu Pengiriman 35%
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag blue">Fleet Management</span>
            <span class="tag blue">WMS</span>
            <span class="tag blue">Route Optimization</span>
            <span class="tag blue">Real-time Tracking</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon purple"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" ry="2" /><path d="M9 22v-4h6v4" /><path d="M8 6h.01" /><path d="M16 6h.01" /><path d="M12 6h.01" /><path d="M12 10h.01" /><path d="M12 14h.01" /><path d="M16 10h.01" /><path d="M16 14h.01" /><path d="M8 10h.01" /><path d="M8 14h.01" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Smart Building</h2>
          <p>Optimasi HVAC, manajemen energi, dan sistem keamanan terintegrasi untuk gedung cerdas.</p>
          <div class="case-study purple">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18" /><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12" /></svg>
            Penghematan Biaya Energi 28%
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag purple">BMS</span>
            <span class="tag purple">HVAC Control</span>
            <span class="tag purple">Energy Monitoring</span>
            <span class="tag purple">Access Control</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon orange"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2" /></svg></div>
          <h2>Energi &amp; Utilitas</h2>
          <p>Monitoring smart grid, manajemen energi terbarukan, dan optimasi infrastruktur utilitas.</p>
          <div class="case-study orange">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18" /><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12" /></svg>
            Peningkatan Efisiensi Grid 18%
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag orange">Smart Grid</span>
            <span class="tag orange">SCADA</span>
            <span class="tag orange">Renewable Monitoring</span>
            <span class="tag orange">Load Balancing</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Proses Implementasi -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">// proses</span>
        <h2>Proses Implementasi</h2>
        <p>Pendekatan terstruktur dari asesmen hingga dukungan berkelanjutan</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps reveal">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <h4>Asesmen</h4>
          <p>Kami menganalisis sistem Anda saat ini dan mengidentifikasi peluang digitalisasi.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <h4>Desain</h4>
          <p>Tim kami merancang arsitektur solusi yang disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan spesifik Anda.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <h4>Implementasi</h4>
          <p>Kami menerapkan dan menjalankan solusi dengan gangguan minimal terhadap operasional.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">4</div>
          <h4>Dukungan</h4>
          <p>Monitoring, pemeliharaan, dan optimasi berkelanjutan untuk perbaikan terus-menerus.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section bracket-box reveal">
        <h2>Siap Mentransformasi Industri Anda?</h2>
        <p>Mari diskusikan bagaimana kami dapat mendigitalisasi operasional Anda.</p>
        <a href="/id/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
          Diskusikan Solusi Anda
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"
            ><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" /></svg
          >
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
